Whether an Untyped is free asks only whether something lies below it,
so one whose delete as a root stopped makes things again over what became roots, or is derived.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: memory that may hold kernel objects overlaps a node not above or below it
Witness: fuzz delete-root-makes-nothing

diff --git a/kernel/object.h b/kernel/object.h
